## SANO Research Report – TDA of Proteins

📁 [`SANO/`](SANO)

Report from my 2026 research internship at the **Sano Centre for Computational Medicine** (Kraków), part of the *Secretome* project on proteins secreted by human gut bacteria.

The project tested whether the **Mapper algorithm** from Topological Data Analysis can map the structure of large protein datasets. Mapper was validated on synthetic shapes and then applied to ~14K proteins using an all-against-all **TM-score** structure-similarity matrix and **ESM-2** language-model embeddings, compared against Foldseek, MMseqs2 and UMAP + HDBSCAN baselines. The report explains why the resulting graphs were fragmented and proposes concrete next steps for scaling the method to 1.4 million proteins.

